{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1713955c-b81c-8c25-946a-9b784a0b490e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T13:16:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Silva",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:13:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:13:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. My recycling bin got left at the curb with a tag on it saying it was rejected. I want to know why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "178 Memorial Boulevard, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One seventy-eight Memorial. Got it. And when was this, today's pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it was last week. I only just noticed the tag because the bin got buried after the storm Friday into Saturday. So how do I know it was even my bin that got tagged?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, if it's got the tag on it, it's the one they passed over. Is there a box checked on the tag, or some wording? Usually they mark a reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] Sorry, I'm putting groceries away and the freezer door is beeping at me. Let me shut that. Okay. It says contaminated. That's all it says."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:14:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Contaminated, okay. That usually means something in there wasn't recyclable, or bagged stuff, like plastic bags with the bottles inside. Food residue can do it too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bagged. So you're telling me if it's in a bag, they just refuse the whole thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, loose items are what they want. Bagged goes in as trash, so the crew will often skip the bin rather than sort it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And you're sure about that? It's not a different reason?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tag only says contaminated, so that's the likeliest. If you want, I can note your address and have someone check the tag notes on their end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. I'll just empty the bags out. When's the next pickup for my street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look. Memorial Boulevard, that's recycling on the, um, hold on. Looks like this Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This Thursday. Not next Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. Monday's your trash day I think, but recycling is Thursday. Put it out the night before or early that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:16:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Thursday for recycling, loose items, no bags. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:16:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:16:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take care."
    }
  ],
